name unicode-case-folding
# CaseFolding.txt. The header names the fields:
#   "# <code>; <status>; <mapping>; # <name>"
#   "# T: special case for uppercase I and dotted uppercase I"
# Only the rows of status T attest here: the rows of status C, F and S are the mappings the XML gives as cf and
# scf. A row says its status and its mapping, as the text it is.
match CaseFolding.txt

tier row by \n
comment hash
remark hash
padded
names code status mapping
tier field by ;

thing row code
range code
codepoints mapping
content status
when status is T
attest row mapping status
